.
.  Generate sample output for chi-square PDF plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
pre-erase off
erase
set ipl1na chspdf.ps
device 2 postscript
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE Chi-Square PDF (3 df)
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
Y1LABEL Probability
X1LABEL X
.
PLOT CHSPDF(X,3) FOR X = 0 0.01 5
.
. box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system mv CHSPDF.PS chspdf.ps
.
quit
